                text: '52-card standard deck. For 3 players: remove 2â™£ (17 cards each). For 5 players: remove 2â™£, 2â™¦ (10 cards each). For 6 players: remove 2â™£, 3â™£, 2â™¦, 3â™¦ (8 cards each). For 4 players: 13 cards each.',
              },
              {
                type: 'paragraph',
                text: '52-card deck, score sheet',
              },
              {
                type: 'paragraph',
                text: 'All cards dealt evenly. Deal and play clockwise. First dealer chosen by cutting cards (highest deals). Turn to deal passes left after each hand.',
              },
